flowchart TD
    A[DM Dashboard / Inbox] --> B{New Work Item?}
    B -->|Plan Appraisal Drawing| C[GM forwards drawing for technical review]
    C --> D[DM receives new version and loop continues]
    D --> E[Check Engineer availability & workload]
    E --> F[Assign to a specific Authorized Engineer]
    F --> G[Engineer works appraisal]
    G --> H{DM reviews appraisal}
    H -->|Appraisal Requires Changes| I[DM sends back to Engineer with feedback]
    I --> G
    H -->|Design Rejected / Amended| J[DM sees amendment / rejection from Engineer]
    J --> K[DM forwards to GM to notify Designer]
    K --> L[GM sends to Designer for correction]
    L --> M[Designer resubmits drawing]
    M --> D
    H -->|Appraisal Approved| N[DM forwards to GM for final approval]
    N --> O[GM approves / sends to Designer]

    B -->|Survey RFI| P[GM forwards a Survey RFI (NSC or In-Service)]
    P --> Q[DM reviews RFI scope & survey type]
    Q --> R[Check Surveyor availability & specialization]
    R --> S[Assign to a specific Authorized Surveyor]
    S --> T[Surveyor schedules, conducts survey, submits report]
    T --> U{DM reviews survey report & observations}
    U -->|Observations exist| V[DM reviews observations and adds remarks]
    V --> W[DM forwards to GM for decision]
    U -->|No observations| X[DM forwards report to GM for final approval & certificate]
    W --> Y{GM decides}
    Y -->|Send back for rework| Z[GM returns to DM]
    Z --> AA[DM instructs Surveyor / Ship Management to perform corrective actions]
    AA --> AB[Follow-up RFI created — loop back to DM scope review]
    AB --> Q
    Y -->|Approve observations| AC[GM approves — observations cleared]
    AC --> AD[DM receives final approval and certificate issuance]
    V --> AE[DM monitors overall project progress & workload]
    X --> AE
    AE --> AF{Any delays or issues?}
    AF -->|Yes| AG[DM escalates to GM with recommendation]
    AF -->|No| AH[Continue regular workflow]
